{# =========================================================
   RoomHive — My Account › Reviews
   templates/user/reviews.html.twig

   REBUILT onto the shared account shell — same recipe as
   help / notifications / bookings / payments / messages:

     - Sidebar: shared partial templates/partials/sidebar.html.twig,
       highlight key 'reviews'. The inline <aside> + its ~110-line
       CSS block are gone (the partial owns them) — and with them
       the Saved Searches entry (removed from the sidebar
       everywhere; help is now the last entry).
     - Footer: shared partials/footer.html.twig added after </main>
       (= legacy user_footer.php).
     - Lucide: guarded loader (window.__rhNavbarLucide — never
       double-loads with the navbar's) replaces the plain CDN tag
       + upRefreshIcons().
     - Reveal: the kill-switch CSS is dropped -> the REAL legacy
       mechanism (.up-reveal waits for .in-view) + the 1.5s
       failsafe so the page can never render blank. The count-up
       animation is untouched (1300ms / threshold 0.6).
     - Collapse: same localStorage key (roomhive_sidebar_collapsed)
       + the updateTitles version (collapsed links get title
       tooltips instead of hidden labels).

   NAVBAR CLEARANCE + LAYOUT — page-local, bulletproof (same fix as
   the help page — this page has the same ub-page-head):
     - The PAGE HEAD above the shell carries the fixed-navbar
       clearance (myaccount.css owns .ub-page-head — same as the
       security page).
     - The shell overrides live on main.up-dashboard (higher
       specificity, always wins vs myaccount.css) with
       max-width: 1560px — occupies the available area instead of
       the legacy ~1240px cap.
     - .up-dashboard .up-sidebar { top: 110px; } — the sticky
       offset matches the other account pages, so the sidebar
       stays clear of the navbar while scrolling (the partial's
       default is 86px).

   Content (1:1 with legacy userreviews.php — nothing content-side
   changed):
   - stat cards with count-up: Reviews Written / Average Rating Given
   - review rows: thumb, title, location, comment, 5 lucide stars
     (filled vs 30%-opacity outline), rating/5, date, chevron.
     Each row opens the listing's detail page (/listings/{id} —
     adjust when that page is ported).
   - empty state → VIEW MY BOOKINGS (/bookings)

   Data from ReviewsController::index (user, reviews, review_count,
   average_rating, notif_count).
   Controller untouched — template-only change. Pure Twig -> Ctrl+F5.
========================================================= #}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
        <title>Reviews · RoomHive</title>

        <script>
            /* theme boot — before paint (same key as profile/payments) */
            (function () {
                try {
                    if (localStorage.getItem("roomhive_theme") === "dark") {
                        document.documentElement.classList.add("dark");
                        document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-theme", "dark");
                    }
                } catch (e) {}
            })();
            document.documentElement.classList.add("js");
        </script>

        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/style.css') }}">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/myaccount.css') }}">

        <style>
            :root {
                --rh-ink: #1c2a38;
                --rh-muted: #66788a;
                --rh-line: #e6ebf1;
                --rh-card: #ffffff;
                --rh-accent: #eda423;
                --rh-accent-deep: #d98c12;
                --rh-radius: 16px;
            }

            body {
                background: #f3f5f9;
            }

            svg.lucide {
                display: inline-block;
                vertical-align: -0.18em;
                flex-shrink: 0;
            }

            /* =========================================================
                                       NAVBAR CLEARANCE + LAYOUT — page-local, bulletproof
                                       The PAGE HEAD above the shell carries the fixed-navbar
                                       clearance (myaccount.css owns .ub-page-head — same as
                                       the security page). The shell overrides live on
                                       main.up-dashboard (higher specificity, always wins vs
                                       myaccount.css) with max-width: 1560px — occupies the
                                       available area instead of the legacy ~1240px cap.
                                    ========================================================== */
            main.up-dashboard {
                margin-top: 0;
                padding: 22px 20px 70px;
                max-width: 1560px;
            }

            /* sticky offset matches the other account pages — when you
                                       scroll, the sidebar sticks at the 110px line instead of
                                       tucking under the navbar (the partial's default is 86px) */
            .up-dashboard .up-sidebar {
                top: 110px;
            }

            /* sidebar markup + styles live in templates/partials/sidebar.html.twig */

            .up-card-head {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: space-between;
                gap: 10px;
                margin-bottom: 14px;
            }
            .up-card-head h3 {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 16px;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
            }

            /* =====================================================
                                       REVIEWS — page styles (carried over 1:1 from legacy
                                       userreviews.php's own <style> block)
                                    ====================================================== */
            .up-stat-card .up-stat-icon {
                width: 34px;
                height: 34px;
                stroke-width: 1.8;
                flex-shrink: 0;
            }
            .up-stat-icon-count {
                color: #b07708;
            }
            /* Reviews Written / Average Rating */
            .up-stat-icon-star {
                color: #eda423;
                fill: #eda423;
            }
            /* Gold star beside the animated average value */
            .up-stat-star {
                width: 14px;
                height: 14px;
                color: #eda423;
                fill: #eda423;
                vertical-align: -0.1em;
            }

            /* Review row stars (replaces &#9733; / &#9734; text) */
            .upr-stars {
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 1px;
            }
            .upr-star {
                width: 13px;
                height: 13px;
            }
            .upr-star-full {
                fill: currentColor;
            }
            .upr-star-empty {
                opacity: 0.3;
            }

            /* Row chevron (was the › text glyph) */
            .up-booking-chevron {
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
            }
            .up-booking-chevron svg {
                width: 16px;
                height: 16px;
            }

            /* Buttons */
            .up-btn-outline svg {
                width: 14px;
                height: 14px;
                vertical-align: -0.15em;
            }

            /* Empty state */
            .up-empty-icon {
                display: block;
                width: 34px;
                height: 34px;
                margin: 0 auto 8px;
                color: #c3c9d2;
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>

        {{ include('partials/navbar.html.twig', {
            is_logged_in: true,
            is_host: is_host ?? false,
            nav_avatar: user.avatar_path ?? null,
            notification_count: notif_count ?? 0,
            current_page: 'reviews'
        }) }}

        <!-- PAGE HEADER — PLAIN -->
        <header class="ub-page-head">
            <span class="ub-eyebrow">Your Voice</span>
            <h1>Reviews you've left</h1>
            <p class="ub-lead">Everything you've shared about the places you've stayed.</p>
        </header>

        <main class="up-dashboard">

            <!-- ==================================================
                 SIDEBAR — shared partial (templates/partials/sidebar.html.twig)
                 highlight = active_sidebar key · collapse JS stays on this page
            =================================================== -->
            {% include 'partials/sidebar.html.twig' with { active_sidebar: 'reviews' } %}

            <div class="up-content">

                <!-- STATS (with count-ups) -->
                <section class="up-stats">
                    <div class="up-stat-card up-reveal" style="--i: 0;">
                        <i data-lucide="pen-line" class="up-stat-icon up-stat-icon-count" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <div>
                            <strong data-count="{{ review_count }}" data-decimals="0">{{ review_count }}</strong>
                            <span>Reviews Written</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="up-stat-card up-reveal" style="--i: 1;">
                        <i data-lucide="star" class="up-stat-icon up-stat-icon-star" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        <div>
                            <strong><span data-count="{{ average_rating }}" data-decimals="1">{{ average_rating }}</span> <i data-lucide="star" class="up-stat-star" aria-hidden="true"></i></strong>
                            <span>Average Rating Given</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- REVIEW LIST -->
                <section class="up-card up-bookings-card up-reveal" style="--i: 1;">
                    <div class="up-card-header">
                        <h3>Your Reviews</h3>
                    </div>

                    {% if reviews is empty %}

                        <div class="up-bookings-empty">
                            <i data-lucide="message-square-plus" class="up-empty-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            <p class="up-bookings-empty-title">No reviews yet</p>
                            <p class="up-bookings-empty-text">After a completed stay, you can leave a review from My Bookings.</p>
                            <a href="/bookings" class="up-btn-outline">
                                <i data-lucide="calendar-days" aria-hidden="true"></i> VIEW MY BOOKINGS
                            </a>
                        </div>

                    {% else %}

                        {% for review in reviews %}
                            <a
                                href="/listings/{{ review.listing_id }}"
                                class="up-booking-row up-reveal"
                                style="--i: {{ min(loop.index0, 6) }}; border-radius:12px;"
                            >
                                <img src="{{ review.thumb }}" alt="{{ review.title }}" class="up-booking-thumb">
                                <div class="up-booking-info">
                                    <h4>{{ review.title }}</h4>
                                    <p class="up-booking-location">{{ review.location }}</p>
                                    {% if review.comment != '' %}
                                        <p class="upr-comment">{{ review.comment }}</p>
                                    {% endif %}
                                </div>
                                <div class="up-booking-side">
                                    <span class="upr-stars" aria-hidden="true">
                                        {% set full = review.rating|round(0, 'floor') %}
                                        {% for s in 1..5 %}
                                            {% if s <= full %}
                                                <i data-lucide="star" class="upr-star upr-star-full"></i>
                                            {% else %}
                                                <i data-lucide="star" class="upr-star upr-star-empty"></i>
                                            {% endif %}
                                        {% endfor %}
                                    </span>
                                    <strong>{{ review.rating }} / 5</strong>
                                    <span>{{ review.date }}</span>
                                </div>
                                <span class="up-booking-chevron"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
                            </a>
                        {% endfor %}

                    {% endif %}
                </section>

            </div>
        </main>

        {{ include('partials/footer.html.twig') }}

        <!-- Lucide — guarded loader, same key as navbar (never double-runs).
             Renders every <i data-lucide="..."> as inline SVG. -->
        <script>
            (function () {
                "use strict";
                function renderRhIcons() {
                    if (window.lucide && typeof window.lucide.createIcons === "function") {
                        window.lucide.createIcons();
                    }
                }
                if (!window.__rhNavbarLucide) {
                    window.__rhNavbarLucide = true;
                    var s = document.createElement("script");
                    s.src = "https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest/dist/umd/lucide.min.js";
                    s.addEventListener("load", renderRhIcons);
                    document.head.appendChild(s);
                }
                if (document.readyState === "loading") {
                    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", renderRhIcons);
                } else {
                    renderRhIcons();
                }
                window.addEventListener("load", renderRhIcons);
            })();
        </script>

        <!-- Sidebar collapse — same behavior + localStorage key as legacy -->
        <script>
            (function () {
                var sidebar = document.getElementById("upSidebar");
                var toggle = document.getElementById("upSidebarToggle");
                if (!sidebar || !toggle) {
                    return;
                }

                var STORAGE_KEY = "roomhive_sidebar_collapsed";
                var links = sidebar.querySelectorAll(".up-side-link");

                function updateTitles(collapsed) {
                    links.forEach(function (link) {
                        var label = link.querySelector(".up-side-label");
                        if (collapsed) {
                            link.setAttribute("title", label ? label.textContent : "");
                        } else {
                            link.removeAttribute("title");
                        }
                    });
                }

                function applyState(collapsed) {
                    sidebar.classList.toggle("collapsed", collapsed);
                    toggle.setAttribute("aria-expanded", collapsed ? "false" : "true");
                    toggle.setAttribute(
                        "aria-label",
                        collapsed ? "Expand sidebar" : "Collapse sidebar",
                    );
                    updateTitles(collapsed);
                }

                var savedCollapsed = false;
                try {
                    savedCollapsed = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY) === "1";
                } catch (e) {}
                applyState(savedCollapsed);

                toggle.addEventListener("click", function () {
                    var nowCollapsed = !sidebar.classList.contains("collapsed");
                    applyState(nowCollapsed);
                    try {
                        localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, nowCollapsed ? "1" : "0");
                    } catch (e) {}
                });
            })();
        </script>

        <!-- Reveal + count-up (self-contained) -->
        <script>
            (function () {
                "use strict";

                var reduced = window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches;

                /* reveal — the REAL legacy mechanism: myaccount.css waits
                                           for .in-view. Plus a 1.5s failsafe so the page can
                                           never render blank. */
                var revealEls = Array.prototype.slice.call(
                    document.querySelectorAll(".up-reveal"),
                );

                function showAll() {
                    revealEls.forEach(function (el) {
                        el.classList.add("in-view");
                    });
                }

                if (reduced || !("IntersectionObserver" in window)) {
                    showAll();
                } else {
                    var io = new IntersectionObserver(
                        function (entries) {
                            entries.forEach(function (entry) {
                                if (!entry.isIntersecting) return;
                                var el = entry.target;
                                io.unobserve(el);
                                el.classList.add("in-view");
                                window.setTimeout(function () {
                                    el.style.setProperty("--i", "0");
                                }, 1200);
                            });
                        },
                        {
                            threshold: 0.12,
                            rootMargin: "0px 0px -40px 0px",
                        },
                    );
                    revealEls.forEach(function (el) {
                        io.observe(el);
                    });

                    /* failsafe — force-reveal anything still hidden after 1.5s */
                    setTimeout(showAll, 1500);
                }

                /* count-up (unchanged) */
                var counters = document.querySelectorAll("[data-count]");
                if (counters.length && !reduced && "IntersectionObserver" in window) {
                    var countIo = new IntersectionObserver(
                        function (entries) {
                            entries.forEach(function (entry) {
                                if (!entry.isIntersecting) return;
                                var el = entry.target;
                                countIo.unobserve(el);

                                var target = parseFloat(el.getAttribute("data-count")) || 0;
                                var decimals =
                                    parseInt(el.getAttribute("data-decimals"), 10) || 0;
                                var t0 = null;
                                var DURATION = 1300;

                                var stepFn = function (ts) {
                                    if (!t0) t0 = ts;
                                    var k = Math.min((ts - t0) / DURATION, 1);
                                    var eased = 1 - Math.pow(1 - k, 3);
                                    el.textContent = (target * eased).toLocaleString(
                                        undefined,
                                        {
                                            minimumFractionDigits: decimals,
                                            maximumFractionDigits: decimals,
                                        },
                                    );
                                    if (k < 1) window.requestAnimationFrame(stepFn);
                                };

                                window.requestAnimationFrame(stepFn);
                            });
                        },
                        {
                            threshold: 0.6,
                        },
                    );
                    Array.prototype.forEach.call(counters, function (el) {
                        countIo.observe(el);
                    });
                }
            })();
        </script>

    </body>

</html>
